<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores on the first</p>
<p>day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches played on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>In Roseau, Dominica: Windward Islands 199 in 57.4 overs</p>
<p>(J.Murray 100). Trinidad and Tobago 91-1.</p>
<p>In Georgetown: Guyana v Barbados - no play.</p>
</text>
